## Local secrets and per-machine config.
## appsettings.json IS tracked (it holds placeholders), but anything that can carry a
## real connection string or token must not be committed. Registry-stored Dropbox
## credentials live in HKCU and never touch the repo.
appsettings.*.local.json
appsettings.user.json
*.env
secrets.json

